Dear Ichabod, there's a Halloween party tonight.

00:31:51.482 --> 00:31:55.505
Please come to my house for dinner at 7.15 pm.

00:31:55.565 --> 00:31:58.046
I am making a chocolate cake.

00:31:58.106 --> 00:32:00.988
My mother is preparing a fruit cake.

00:32:01.048 --> 00:32:04.988
My grandmother is preparing a pumpkin pie.

00:32:05.048 --> 00:32:08.046
After dinner, we can walk in the garden.

00:32:08.106 --> 00:32:11.678
