At 9.30 pm, we can dance and sing.

00:32:16.451 --> 00:32:24.785
Please wear your Halloween costume, your friend, Katrina.

00:32:24.845 --> 00:32:36.779
Chapter 5 The Ghosts of Sleepy Hollow After dinner, a small orchestra plays music.

00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:39.281
Ichabod dances with Katrina.

00:32:39.341 --> 00:32:41.833
He says sweet things to her.

00:32:41.893 --> 00:32:45.806
Katrina smiles at Ichabod and he smiles at her.

00:32:45.866 --> 00:32:47.958
Brom isn't dancing.

00:32:48.018 --> 00:32:50.039
He is sitting in a corner.

00:32:50.099 --> 00:32:52.511
He is watching Katrina and Ichabod.

00:32:52.571 --> 00:32:55.072
He is angry and jealous.

00:32:55.133 --> 00:32:58.496
Ichabod is a good dancer, but I can't dance.

00:32:58.556 --> 00:33:01.222
What can I do to win Katrina?

00:33:01.282 --> 00:33:05.870
After the dance, everyone goes outside and sits under the trees.

00:33:05.930 --> 00:33:09.362
They talk about the American Revolutionary War.

00:33:09.422 --> 00:33:15.095
When I look at the river, I remember the battles between the British and the Americans.

00:33:15.155 --> 00:33:18.317
I fought alone against the British with my small sword.

00:33:18.377 --> 00:33:19.908
Says an old farmer.

00:33:19.968 --> 00:33:25.434
A young farmer says, When the British saw my new musket, they ran away.

00:33:25.494 --> 00:33:28.559
We're all heroes of the American Revolutionary War.

00:33:28.619 --> 00:33:30.079
Says another man.

00:33:30.139 --> 00:33:33.130
They also talk about ghosts.

00:33:33.190 --> 00:33:35.591
Raven Rock is haunted.

00:33:35.651 --> 00:33:38.532
There's the ghost of a woman in white.

00:33:38.592 --> 00:33:41.353
I always see her ghost before a storm.

00:33:41.413 --> 00:33:44.464
She's scary, says a young woman.

00:33:44.524 --> 00:33:49.085
When I pass by the big tree near the church, I hear terrible cries.

00:33:49.145 --> 00:33:51.456
It's the ghost of Major Andre.

00:33:51.516 --> 00:33:52.590
Says a boy.

00:33:52.650 --> 00:33:55.326
The headless horseman is the most horrible.

00:33:55.386 --> 00:33:58.677
He gallops on his big black horse and follows you.

00:33:58.737 --> 00:34:00.808
Sometimes he takes you away.

00:34:00.868 --> 00:34:03.729
When there is a full moon, you can see him clearly.

00:34:03.789 --> 00:34:05.500
Says a tall man.

00:34:05.560 --> 00:34:10.422
Ichabod listens to these stories and believes them.

00:34:10.482 --> 00:34:14.833
Soon the farmers and their families start going home.

00:34:14.893 --> 00:34:18.426
Ichabod wants to stay and talk to Katrina.

00:34:18.486 --> 00:34:20.340
This is the right moment.

00:34:20.400 --> 00:34:22.840
I must ask Katrina to marry me.

00:34:22.900 --> 00:34:24.081
He thinks.

00:34:24.141 --> 00:34:31.323
No one knows what happens between Katrina and Ichabod, but he is very sad when he leaves the Fantasal house.

00:34:31.383 --> 00:34:35.058
Does Katrina prefer bram?

00:34:35.118 --> 00:34:40.902
Ichabod gets on gunpowder and starts riding to Van Ripper's farm.

00:34:40.962 --> 00:34:43.243
It is a very dark night.

00:34:43.303 --> 00:34:45.894
Clouds cover the stars.

00:34:45.954 --> 00:34:49.645
Ichabod thinks about the ghosts of sleepy hollow.

00:34:49.705 --> 00:34:53.416
He hears a strange noise in the forest.

00:34:53.477 --> 00:34:55.897
Is it the voice of a ghost?

00:34:55.957 --> 00:34:57.698
Or is the wind?

00:34:57.758 --> 00:35:00.619
Something is moving in the sky.

00:35:00.679 --> 00:35:01.969
Is it a witch?

00:35:02.029 --> 00:35:05.048
Is it the ghost of the woman in white?

00:35:05.109 --> 00:35:07.338
What a mysterious night.

00:35:07.398 --> 00:35:08.768
Ichabod thinks.

00:35:08.828 --> 00:35:11.179
He is lonely and sad.

00:35:11.240 --> 00:35:14.500
He rides very quickly.

00:35:14.560 --> 00:35:18.762
He comes to a brook with a small bridge.

00:35:18.822 --> 00:35:21.674
It is very difficult to cross the bridge.

00:35:21.734 --> 00:35:26.306
On the other side of the brook, Ichabod sees some enormous trees.

00:35:26.366 --> 00:35:30.632
It is dark, and he is afraid.

00:35:30.692 --> 00:35:34.368
Major Andrei's ghost lives here.

00:35:34.428 --> 00:35:35.148
He thinks.

00:35:35.208 --> 00:35:37.760
I must cross this bridge quickly.

00:35:37.821 --> 00:35:43.014
Ichabod kicks gunpowder and says, Come on gunpowder, cross the bridge quickly.

00:35:43.074 --> 00:35:45.506
But the old horse does not move.

00:35:45.567 --> 00:35:49.380
Ichabod kicks gunpowder again and again.

00:35:49.440 --> 00:35:54.104
Finally the horse moves, but then he stops suddenly.

00:35:54.164 --> 00:35:56.355
Ichabod nearly falls off.

00:35:56.416 --> 00:35:59.047
He is very nervous.

00:35:59.107 --> 00:36:01.718
What is happening to me tonight?

00:36:01.758 --> 00:36:02.718
He thinks.

00:36:02.778 --> 00:36:06.590
Then he hears a strange sound on the other side of the brook.

00:36:06.650 --> 00:36:12.292
In the shadow of the trees, he sees something big and black.

00:36:12.352 --> 00:36:14.573
Oh no.

00:36:14.633 --> 00:36:16.794
Something is waiting for me.

00:36:16.854 --> 00:36:18.875
It isn't moving.

00:36:18.935 --> 00:36:20.917
It is waiting for me.

00:36:20.977 --> 00:36:22.919
I cannot go back.

00:36:22.979 --> 00:36:24.170
What must I do?

00:36:24.190 --> 00:36:25.190
He thinks.

00:36:25.250 --> 00:36:27.362
His heart is beating fast.

00:36:27.422 --> 00:36:29.373
His hair is standing up.

00:36:29.434 --> 00:36:33.496
His mouth is dry and his hands are very cold.

00:36:33.556 --> 00:36:34.677
Who are you?

00:36:34.697 --> 00:36:36.928
Ichabod asks.

00:36:36.988 --> 00:36:39.290
There is no answer.

00:36:39.350 --> 00:36:40.991
Who are you?

00:36:41.051 --> 00:36:42.742
He asks again.

00:36:42.803 --> 00:36:45.064
His teeth are chattering.

00:36:45.124 --> 00:36:47.621
There is still no answer.

00:36:47.682 --> 00:36:54.902
Ichabod closes his eyes and starts singing a church song.

00:36:54.962 --> 00:36:59.314
At that moment, the big black thing moves again.

00:36:59.374 --> 00:37:03.087
It jumps out into the road and Ichabod opens his eyes.

00:37:03.147 --> 00:37:11.431
The night is dark, but he can see a horseman on a big black horse.

00:37:11.492 --> 00:37:22.946
Chapter 6 The Night Ride Ichabod forces the horse to gallop.

00:37:23.006 --> 00:37:25.076
The horseman follows him.

00:37:25.136 --> 00:37:29.547
Ichabod thinks about the horrible stories of the headless horseman.

00:37:29.608 --> 00:37:34.159
Gunpowder gallops fast, but the horseman gallops fast too.

00:37:34.219 --> 00:37:38.330
Ichabod wants to sing a church song, but his mouth is dry.

00:37:38.390 --> 00:37:40.440
They gallop up a hill.

00:37:40.500 --> 00:37:44.532
Against the night sky, Ichabod sees the horseman.

00:37:44.592 --> 00:37:46.192
He is headless.

00:37:46.252 --> 00:37:49.437
He is carrying his head on his saddle.

00:37:49.497 --> 00:37:51.642
Ichabod is terrified.

00:37:51.702 --> 00:37:53.903
He hits gunpowder again and again.

00:37:53.963 --> 00:37:56.704
He wants the old horse to gallop fast.

00:37:56.764 --> 00:38:01.576
But the headless horseman follows him with his big black horse.

00:38:01.636 --> 00:38:04.788
The road to Van Ripper's farm is on the left.

00:38:04.848 --> 00:38:06.878
But gunpowder turns right.

00:38:06.938 --> 00:38:10.581
This road goes to the church bridge and the church cemetery.

00:38:10.641 --> 00:38:13.903
Ichabod and Gunpowder gallop down the hill.

00:38:13.963 --> 00:38:18.635
Suddenly Ichabod's saddle falls off, but the horse does not stop.

00:38:18.695 --> 00:38:19.756
Oh no.

00:38:19.816 --> 00:38:21.116
Think, Ichabod?

00:38:21.176 --> 00:38:24.178
That is Van Ripper's best saddle.

00:38:24.238 --> 00:38:27.318
Ichabod clasps Gunpowder's neck.

00:38:27.379 --> 00:38:29.359
He tries to stay on the horse.

00:38:29.419 --> 00:38:31.860
The headless horseman is behind him.

00:38:31.920 --> 00:38:34.091
Ichabod is very scared.

00:38:34.151 --> 00:38:36.433
His teeth are chattering.

00:38:36.494 --> 00:38:38.926
The church bridge is near here.

00:38:38.986 --> 00:38:39.877
He thinks.

00:38:39.937 --> 00:38:43.029
Ghosts usually disappear after the church bridge.

00:38:43.090 --> 00:38:46.442
I must cross the bridge, then I'm safe.

00:38:46.502 --> 00:38:50.125
Ichabod and Gunpowder gallop across the church bridge.

00:38:50.185 --> 00:38:54.328
Ichabod looks back, and the headless horseman is still there.

00:38:54.388 --> 00:38:57.670
He has a big round object in his hands.

00:38:57.730 --> 00:39:02.967
He throws it at Ichabod.

00:39:03.027 --> 00:39:07.622
It's his head!

00:39:07.682 --> 00:39:09.133
Crys Ichabod.

00:39:09.193 --> 00:39:13.744
The big head hits Ichabod and there is a loud thud.

00:39:13.804 --> 00:39:18.156
Ichabod falls to the ground and Gunpowder gallops away.

00:39:18.216 --> 00:39:24.718
The next morning Gunpowder arrives at Van Ripper's farm, but Ichabod isn't there for breakfast.

00:39:24.778 --> 00:39:29.490
Ichabod isn't at school, and he isn't at Van Ripper's farm.

00:39:29.550 --> 00:39:31.391
Where is Ichabod?

00:39:31.451 --> 00:39:32.511
asks Van Ripper.

00:39:32.571 --> 00:39:34.684
And where is my best saddle?

00:39:34.745 --> 00:39:38.400
Van Ripper and his friends look for Ichabod everywhere.

00:39:38.460 --> 00:39:41.302
They find the saddle on the road near the church.

00:39:41.362 --> 00:39:45.706
They find Ichabod's hat and a broken pumpkin near the river.

00:39:45.766 --> 00:39:48.838
But they can't find Ichabod's body.

00:39:48.899 --> 00:39:52.622
It's the Headless Horseman, poor Ichabod Crane.

00:39:52.682 --> 00:39:53.922
Says Van Ripper.

00:39:53.982 --> 00:39:56.364
Yes, it's the Headless Horseman.

00:39:56.424 --> 00:39:57.966
Oh, poor Ichabod!

00:39:58.026 --> 00:40:00.120
Say his friends.

00:40:00.180 --> 00:40:06.363
Years later, an old farmer returning from New York says to the people of Sleepy Hollow.

00:40:06.423 --> 00:40:08.854
Ichabod Crane is alive and well.

00:40:08.914 --> 00:40:10.864
Now he is a congressman.

00:40:10.924 --> 00:40:15.385
He left Sleepy Hollow because Katrina wanted to marry Brom Bones.

00:40:15.445 --> 00:40:19.176
Katrina, hearing this, asks her husband Brom.

00:40:19.236 --> 00:40:23.587
What do you know about Ichabod Crane in the pumpkin?

00:40:23.647 --> 00:40:27.689
Brom laughs loudly.

00:40:27.749 --> 00:40:36.577
At Sleepy Hollow, people say that only Brahm knows the true story of Ichabod Crane and the Headless Horseman.

00:40:36.637 --> 00:40:39.199
It is Brahm's secret.

00:40:39.260 --> 00:40:47.016
Now, on winter evenings, the old women tell the terrible story of Ichabod Crane and the Headless Horseman.

